{"steam_appid":2659900,"steam_name":"Sixty Four","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2659900/657394/ea19dcd71c82ec4f94f5517098db7b2af87ce252/1750940725/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1709162283","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256998042/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1709162283","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/ss_c1ee6513d964a3fc8994ef9b7d6db9fc8ebfaa89.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/ss_9fec60bf73bf70bde340bad9935b44ef1e1282c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/ss_0f41fa7c9dc78042e3b6d4b5b90e9b70e8a27def.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/ss_dc01f4e853deff5d3fe342ff6415ee4395fae686.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/ss_99930a72c2b9fa05d3398cb0fa474895c2c3ab71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786114713"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer, Sixty Four is a clicker game that gradually becomes more idle with every machine you unlock, up to the the ultimate goal of full automation. Upgrade a factory in an extraordinary world. Progress to unlock new resources and machines, leading to new ways to expand and grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>❒ From Foundation to Complexity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey with a simple machine generating distinct cubes. Use combinations of cubes to unlock advanced machinery and new gameplay elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/e2f566664a1506a79e4ad4a7fb8de19f.poster.avif?t=1786114713\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/e2f566664a1506a79e4ad4a7fb8de19f.webm?t=1786114713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/e2f566664a1506a79e4ad4a7fb8de19f.mp4?t=1786114713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>❒ An Evolving Factory Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your factory is not just a collection of simple machines; it's a dynamic environment of challenges and strategy. Face new situations and discover opportunities with every innovative and abstract machine you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/1b122f8b456672556af3d41dace20b6a.poster.avif?t=1786114713\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/1b122f8b456672556af3d41dace20b6a.webm?t=1786114713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/1b122f8b456672556af3d41dace20b6a.mp4?t=1786114713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>❒ A Fresh Mix of Gaming Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sixty Four combines simple yet engaging elements from idle, incremental, and strategy games. Pursue constant improvement and unravel the secrets behind messages from an unknown entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/4fc75b57870650ca762277d20cd7d8a6.poster.avif?t=1786114713\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/4fc75b57870650ca762277d20cd7d8a6.webm?t=1786114713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659900/extras/4fc75b57870650ca762277d20cd7d8a6.mp4?t=1786114713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Jake Chudnow</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 4 processor or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Oleg Danilov"],"publishers":["Playsaurus"],"release_date":"4 Mar, 2024"}